   "id": "c3e0c9a00bc9b3add8af6ca459599229fc345242",
   "message": "fix(study): prove the clock domain by zero time-namespace offsets\n\nDocker 29.7.2/runc 1.4.3 gives every container its own zero-offset time\nnamespace, so inode equality refused the valid shared CLOCK_MONOTONIC domain\n(real E preparation failure). Require same boot, ns/time==time_for_children\nand zero monotonic/boottime timens_offsets in driver, runtime, sidecar\nworker observation, native probe, coordinator and study reference. Genuine\nRED with a real unshared time namespace, GREEN plus refusals; update the\nexperiments.yaml probe source pin.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
   "timestamp": "2026-10-05T12:30:19Z",
   "tree_id": "a9e87adb062830019f25d048e8deb7b51b65e391"
